  "rationale": "BindingTyped.variable requires a fresh variable and retains the admissible type. fieldDescription chooses none for a negative direct field and otherwise focuses an initialized field. FieldBindings builds every named destination description; BindingTyped.unpack requires base-class equality, declaration membership, a permutation of all declared field names, distinct/fresh destinations, and well-formed output. This matches declaration-order presentation with reorderable patterns and empty/partial transferred fields. given.patterns introduces b, environments supplies B/Gamma and admissibility, and focus supplies the projected type. There is no requirement for whole interior subtrees beyond the focused view.",
